  "prefLabel": "Soil 103.04 Organization",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Soil 103.04 Organization. In October of even years, the board shall meet and organize and, by election from among its members, select a chairperson and vice-chairperson.\n\nSource. #8006, eff 12-18-03; ss by #14535, eff 4-1-26 (formerly Soil 103.05)",
